-- hr_question_bank_wipe_before_reload.sql once first, then all 7 parts, in
-- any order. Idempotent: safe to re-run, upserts on primary key.
-- Scoring: FIB = 5/0/0/0/0 (only the correct fill earns credit); MCQ and SJT
